Yaesu FT-710.</p><p><strong>FreeRig710:</strong> ESP32-P4 radio control, live video, browser audio and integrated FT8.</p><p><strong>Unified audio/PTT:</strong> the production GUI uses <code>/api/v1/audio/ws</code> for RX PCM, browser microphone PCM and latching PTT with a 1.5 s safety watchdog.</p><p><img class="video" src="/video.mjpeg" alt="Live HDMI video"></p><ul><li><a href="/video.mjpeg">/video.mjpeg</a> (live MJPEG)</li><li><a href="/api/v1/hardware/audio">/api/v1/hardware/audio</a> (RX + TX UAC1 status)</li><li><a href="/api/v1/hardware/cat">/api/v1/hardware/cat</a></li><li><a href="/api/v1/radio/state">/api/v1/radio/state</a></li><li><a href="/api/v1/hardware/usb">/api/v1/hardware/usb</a></li><li><a href="/api/v1/health">/api/v1/health</a></li></ul></body></html>␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Xp@1␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Tp@2␀␀␀␀␀␀␀hp@3␀␀␀␀␀␀␀0„@4␀␀␀␀␀␀Р@5␀␀␀␀␀␀€p@6␀␀␀␀␀␀␀pp@7␀␀␀␀␀␀␀А@8␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ђp@9␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Рq@A␀␀␀␀␀␀Ђp@B␀␀␀␀␀␀дp@C␀␀␀␀␀␀␀xp@D␀␀␀␀␀␀ґ¬@E␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Дq@F␀␀␀␀␀␀␀‚@А@$А@,А@4А@<А@xz@DА@LА@TА@дЃ@\А@dА@pz@lА@tА@dz@0␀␀␀|А@1␀␀␀€А@2␀␀␀”А@3␀␀␀¬А@4␀␀␀ДА@6␀␀␀ЬА@7␀␀␀фА@9␀␀␀Б@A␀␀␀␀H␀$Б@А3␀O␀,Б@@w␀Ђ„␀4Б@аg5␀␀	=␀<Б@ 5M␀)S␀@Б@АПj␀ co␀DБ@ љ␀pаљ␀HБ@ЂџХ␀°цЪ␀LБ@ ІА8PБ@@o@MGTБ@ђК{0Q}XБ@␀?« /Е\Б@ЂръЂщ7`Б@Ђ,А_;dБ@0123456789ABCDEF␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀p—@␀␀␀␀␀␀@␀␀␀␀␀pЗ@␀␀␀␀␀␀™@␀␀␀␀␀␀T@␀␀␀␀␀ќМ@␀␀␀␀␀И™@␀␀␀␀␀␀рї␀␀␀␀␀␀р?␀␀␀␀␀:ў@␀␀␀␀␀␀@␀␀␀␀␀␀@333333у?љ™™™™™Щ?␀␀␀␀␀pз@␀␀␀␀␀LН@␀␀␀␀␀␀4@љ™™™™™й?␀␀␀␀␀@Џ@␀␀␀␀␀␀°<␀␀АяяяЯA␀␀␀␀␀␀аБяяяяяяп␀␀␀␀␀␀ш␀␀␀␀␀␀рНМММММММ␀␀␀␀␀аБб=UUUUХ?ЏВu=␀␀ В␀␀ЂїЧЈp?␀@F␀␀ AНМL>␀␀␀В␀␀ A␀юяF␀␀zD␀␀Ђ␀␀Ђ?␀Єё?pҐм6␀␀Ђ>␀␀␀?;Єё?␀␀ЂKBсS>U2l>Ј‹>«ЄЄ>·mЫ>љ™?␀␀@@␀@v?O8v?Ж#цё<Є83␀r1?r1?Њѕї5L»13кЭ5UіЉ8a6;«Є*>␀␀␀@␀␀␀L␀␀␀3␀␀ЂЂ␀␀Ђ␀яяяяяjpeg_del_encoder_engine␀s_cfg_desc␀␀s_jpeg_set_header_info␀␀jpeg_ll_sample_mode_select␀␀s_jpeg_enc_transaction_on_job_picked␀␀␀␀jpeg_encoder_process␀␀␀␀jpeg_encoder_process␀␀␀␀jpeg_new_encoder_engine␀jpeg_new_encoder_engine␀jpeg_check_intr_priority␀␀␀␀jpeg_acquire_code